We are pleased to launch the demo for our PC game =96 =93The Legend of
Vraz=94.

The Legend of Vraz is a 2D action packed adventure arcade game for
Windows PC. This game features hours and hours of fun filled exciting
gameplay amidst fantasy worlds created with stunning hand painted 2D
art and inhabited by mesmerizing characters.

It is the first Indian arcade game and is based upon the Indian
Miniature style paintings.  It is playable by audiences of all ages
and its unique style will appeal to hardcore, causal and even new
gamers.

If you ever wondered what would happen if Mario and Prince of Persia
met India then Legend of Vraz is your answer.

Further information, screenshots and the free demo can be found on the
official webpage: http://www.zatungames.com

